// Title: Remote DLL Load Via Rundll32.EXE
// Sigma ID: f40017b3-cb2e-4335-ab5d-3babf679c1de
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-09-18 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: execution, T1204.002
// Description: Detects a remote DLL load event via "rundll32.exe".
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://github.com/gabe-k/themebleed
//   - Internal Research
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/05d1031f537e830b76da53bae2400c5814c89165/rules/windows/image_load/image_load_rundll32_remote_share_load.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, microsoft_xdr schema)

DeviceImageLoadEvents
| where InitiatingProcessFolderPath endswith "\\rundll32.exe" and FolderPath startswith "\\\\"
